+Case-fatality rates show how outcomes differ after patients reach hospital care. This briefing uses confirmed in-hospital deaths as its primary, conservative estimates. The uncertainty range shown for recent periods reflects possible additional in-hospital deaths whose discharge status needs verification; it should not be treated as a confirmed change in outcomes.
